    <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top; text-align: justify;">
                <div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Includes sales of beauty and wellness products in our core Nu Skin business. This includes $216 million, $268 million, and $342 million in sales of devices and related consumables for the years ended
                  December 31, 2025, 2024 and 2023, respectively. For purposes of this table, sales of <span style="font-style: italic;">Prysm iO</span> are included in the wellness category and all other devices, including <span style="font-style: italic;">ageLOC WellSpa iO</span> and <span style="font-style: italic;">Nu Skin RenuSpa iO, </span>are included in the beauty category.</div>
