  <ix:continuation id="Text_7891bca57bc341d48970d3bc2cba0c6d268" continuedAt="Text_7891bca57bc341d48970d3bc2cba0c6d269"><ix:continuation id="Text_cc08c9ee6dd24fa388b12885dc19758b13" continuedAt="Text_cc08c9ee6dd24fa388b12885dc19758b14">
<div><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;"> </span></div>
</ix:continuation></ix:continuation>
  <div style="text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;">
    <div>
      <ix:continuation id="Text_7891bca57bc341d48970d3bc2cba0c6d269" continuedAt="Text_7891bca57bc341d48970d3bc2cba0c6d270"><ix:continuation id="Text_cc08c9ee6dd24fa388b12885dc19758b14" continuedAt="Text_cc08c9ee6dd24fa388b12885dc19758b15">
<div style="text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-transform: none;">At December 31, 2025, the Company had $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:UnrecognizedTaxBenefits" id="Fact_f6439c70e6ac48d3aabe9a45b218e4eb" contextRef="c20251231_IncomeTaxAuthorityAxis_DomesticAndForeignAuthoritiesMember" unitRef="U001" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">21.8</ix:nonFraction> million in unrecognized tax benefits, all of which, if recognized, would affect the effective tax rate. In comparison, at December 31, 2024, the
        Company had $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:UnrecognizedTaxBenefits" id="Fact_8ed5085e550f485d828b12580c098129" contextRef="c20241231_IncomeTaxAuthorityAxis_DomesticAndForeignAuthoritiesMember" unitRef="U001" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">25.9</ix:nonFraction> million in unrecognized tax benefits, all of which, if recognized, would affect the effective tax rate. The Company&#8217;s
        unrecognized tax benefits relate to multiple foreign and domestic jurisdictions. Potential changes in unrecognized tax benefits can arise from the multiple jurisdictions in which the Company operates, as well as the expiration of various statutes
        of limitation and possible completion of tax examinations.</div>
</ix:continuation></ix:continuation>
    </div>

  </div>

  <ix:continuation id="Text_7891bca57bc341d48970d3bc2cba0c6d270" continuedAt="Text_7891bca57bc341d48970d3bc2cba0c6d271"><ix:continuation id="Text_cc08c9ee6dd24fa388b12885dc19758b15" continuedAt="Text_cc08c9ee6dd24fa388b12885dc19758b16">
<div><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;"> </span></div>
</ix:continuation></ix:continuation>
  <ix:continuation id="Text_7891bca57bc341d48970d3bc2cba0c6d271" continuedAt="Text_7891bca57bc341d48970d3bc2cba0c6d272"><ix:continuation id="Text_cc08c9ee6dd24fa388b12885dc19758b16" continuedAt="Text_cc08c9ee6dd24fa388b12885dc19758b17">
<div style="text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;"> <span style="font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-transform: none;"><br/>
    </span></div>
</ix:continuation></ix:continuation>
  <ix:continuation id="Text_7891bca57bc341d48970d3bc2cba0c6d272" continuedAt="Text_7891bca57bc341d48970d3bc2cba0c6d273"><ix:continuation id="Text_cc08c9ee6dd24fa388b12885dc19758b17" continuedAt="Text_cc08c9ee6dd24fa388b12885dc19758b18">
<div><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;"> <span style="font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-transform: none;"> </span> </span></div>
</ix:continuation></ix:continuation>
  <ix:continuation id="Text_7891bca57bc341d48970d3bc2cba0c6d273" continuedAt="Text_7891bca57bc341d48970d3bc2cba0c6d274"><ix:continuation id="Text_cc08c9ee6dd24fa388b12885dc19758b18">
<div style="text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-transform: none;">During the years ended December 31, 2025, 2024, and 2023 the
    Company recognized $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:UnrecognizedTaxBenefitsIncomeTaxPenaltiesAndInterestExpense" id="Fact_f95ba5fdc1814263a1392aa0de208b87" contextRef="c20250101to20251231_IncomeTaxAuthorityAxis_DomesticAndForeignAuthoritiesMember" unitRef="U001" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">1.8</ix:nonFraction> million, $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:UnrecognizedTaxBenefitsIncomeTaxPenaltiesAndInterestExpense" id="Fact_4d665fd36e7d435d87622df4d4858224" contextRef="c20240101to20241231_IncomeTaxAuthorityAxis_DomesticAndForeignAuthoritiesMember" unitRef="U001" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">0.7</ix:nonFraction>
    million, and $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:UnrecognizedTaxBenefitsIncomeTaxPenaltiesAndInterestExpense" id="Fact_eb75aea027174c1e8f0f0439ba78ae67" contextRef="c20230101to20231231_IncomeTaxAuthorityAxis_DomesticAndForeignAuthoritiesMember" unitRef="U001" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">0.6</ix:nonFraction> million, respectively, in interest and penalties expenses related to uncertain tax positions. The Company had $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:UnrecognizedTaxBenefitsIncomeTaxPenaltiesAndInterestAccrued" id="Fact_02b89bdac5a6449eb0e19695bd0e29b6" contextRef="c20251231_IncomeTaxAuthorityAxis_DomesticAndForeignAuthoritiesMember" unitRef="U001" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">15.5</ix:nonFraction> million, $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:UnrecognizedTaxBenefitsIncomeTaxPenaltiesAndInterestAccrued" id="Fact_344527faf1fd46f08e91411a1fdede09" contextRef="c20241231_IncomeTaxAuthorityAxis_DomesticAndForeignAuthoritiesMember" unitRef="U001" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">13.7</ix:nonFraction> million, and $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:UnrecognizedTaxBenefitsIncomeTaxPenaltiesAndInterestAccrued" id="Fact_06d3e2886ed74f65b82d2c04eb662d05" contextRef="c20231231_IncomeTaxAuthorityAxis_DomesticAndForeignAuthoritiesMember" unitRef="U001" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">13.0</ix:nonFraction> million of accrued interest and penalties related to uncertain tax positions at December 31, 2025, 2024, and 2023, respectively. Interest and penalties
    related to uncertain tax positions are recognized as a component of income tax expense.</div>
</ix:continuation></ix:continuation><ix:continuation id="Text_7891bca57bc341d48970d3bc2cba0c6d274" continuedAt="Text_7891bca57bc341d48970d3bc2cba0c6d275">
<div>
   <span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;"> <span style="font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-transform: none;"> </span> </span></div>
</ix:continuation>
