            <div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;"><ix:footnote id="Foot_45af50350d16401285cc43de40717f35" footnoteRole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US">Construction in progress includes $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PropertyPlantAndEquipmentGross" id="Fact_440c3278ef05474f85faa58963bc366e" contextRef="c20251231_PropertyPlantAndEquipmentByTypeAxis_SoftwareDevelopmentMember" unitRef="U001" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">5.3</ix:nonFraction> million and $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PropertyPlantAndEquipmentGross" id="Fact_c0e5a3fddaa948c0b976ff737f7a50f8" contextRef="c20241231_PropertyPlantAndEquipmentByTypeAxis_SoftwareDevelopmentMember" unitRef="U001" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">5.2</ix:nonFraction> million as of
