<div style="text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;">Depreciation of property and equipment totaled $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Depreciation" id="Fact_de3c221dd5b04368b1a5a4a0f5f2a539" contextRef="c20250101to20251231" unitRef="U001" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">43.9</ix:nonFraction>
      million, $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Depreciation" id="Fact_902fc125409a4fc6ac9d42b0914e68cd" contextRef="c20240101to20241231" unitRef="U001" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">56.2</ix:nonFraction> million and $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Depreciation" id="Fact_ca7b0f206d4945b0b6456681bd867ddc" contextRef="c20230101to20231231" unitRef="U001" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">57.7</ix:nonFraction>
      million for the years ended December 31, 2025, 2024 and 2023, respectively.&#160; The Company recorded impairments of $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ImpairmentOfLongLivedAssetsHeldForUse" id="Fact_8865094161d0423c89fcd8d9a702126a" contextRef="c20240101to20241231" unitRef="U001" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">36.6</ix:nonFraction> million for the year
      ended December 31, 2024, in connection with our 2023 restructuring plan, see Note 18 &#8211; <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Fact_01f1f9b48f144ced96f203c492511d72">Restructuring and Severance Charges</span>.</div>
</ix:continuation>

