<div style="text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;">The Company has additional lease liabilities of $<ix:nonFraction name="nus:LesseeOperatingLeaseLeaseNotYetCommencedLiabilityNotAccrued" id="Fact_728ee20f99094db7b81edc4b4fdd31e9" contextRef="c20251231" unitRef="U001" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">37.7</ix:nonFraction>
        million which have not yet commenced as of December 31, 2025, and as such, have not been recognized on the consolidated balance sheets.</div>
</ix:continuation>
