    </div>

    <ix:continuation id="Text_822fc62e885c49fea9346b0ffdc4e97119" continuedAt="Text_822fc62e885c49fea9346b0ffdc4e97120">
<div><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"> </span></div>
</ix:continuation>
    <ix:continuation id="Text_822fc62e885c49fea9346b0ffdc4e97120" continuedAt="Text_822fc62e885c49fea9346b0ffdc4e97121">
<div style="text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; font-style: italic;">Repurchases of common stock</div>
</ix:continuation>
    <ix:continuation id="Text_822fc62e885c49fea9346b0ffdc4e97121" continuedAt="Text_822fc62e885c49fea9346b0ffdc4e97122">
<div><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"> </span></div>
</ix:continuation>
    <ix:continuation id="Text_822fc62e885c49fea9346b0ffdc4e97122">
<div style="text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;"><br/>
      <span style="display: inline; float: none; letter-spacing: normal; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none;">In July 2018, the Company&#8217;s board of directors approved a stock repurchase plan with an authorization amount of $<ix:nonFraction name="srt:StockRepurchaseProgramAuthorizedAmount1" id="Fact_3b858628b8774c18bd5416284c67f8af" contextRef="c20180731_ShareRepurchaseProgramAxis_StockRepurchasePlan2018Member" unitRef="U001" decimals="-6" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">500</ix:nonFraction>
        million. The repurchases are used primarily for strategic initiatives and to offset dilution from the Company&#8217;s equity incentive plans. During the year ended December 31, 2025, the Company purchased&#160;<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:TreasuryStockSharesAcquired" id="Fact_c550a65a140748ce9960e37eb1a5f8c3" contextRef="c20250101to20251231_ShareRepurchaseProgramAxis_StockRepurchasePlan2018Member_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_TreasuryStockCommonMember" unitRef="U002" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">2.0</ix:nonFraction> million shares under the 2018 plan for $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:TreasuryStockValueAcquiredCostMethod" id="Fact_da4a741d54e3444ca34ae1c2a12aa50c" contextRef="c20250101to20251231_ShareRepurchaseProgramAxis_StockRepurchasePlan2018Member_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_TreasuryStockCommonMember" unitRef="U001" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">20.0</ix:nonFraction> million. During
        the year ended December 31, 2024, the Company purchased&#160;<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:TreasuryStockSharesAcquired" id="Fact_5992410e2bcf4d98b37004908e44de1f" contextRef="c20240101to20241231_ShareRepurchaseProgramAxis_StockRepurchasePlan2018Member_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_TreasuryStockCommonMember" unitRef="U002" decimals="-6" scale="6" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen">no</ix:nonFraction> shares. During the year ended December 31, 2023, the Company purchased&#160;<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:TreasuryStockSharesAcquired" id="Fact_76f062a1f6504466bbbe1549a91c7a83" contextRef="c20230101to20231231_ShareRepurchaseProgramAxis_StockRepurchasePlan2018Member_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_TreasuryStockCommonMember" unitRef="U002" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">0.6</ix:nonFraction> million shares under the 2018 plan for $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:TreasuryStockValueAcquiredCostMethod" id="Fact_d1c28eea73854edc8e5f0aa3537a6dfa" contextRef="c20230101to20231231_ShareRepurchaseProgramAxis_StockRepurchasePlan2018Member_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_TreasuryStockCommonMember" unitRef="U001" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">13.0</ix:nonFraction>
        million. At December 31, 2025, $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockRepurchaseProgramRemainingAuthorizedRepurchaseAmount1" id="Fact_8bbfd0dc44bc45fca92d9cb666a16255" contextRef="c20251231_ShareRepurchaseProgramAxis_StockRepurchasePlan2018Member" unitRef="U001" decimals="-5" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">142.3</ix:nonFraction> million was available for repurchases under the 2018 stock repurchase plan.</span></div>
</ix:continuation>

    <div style="text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-weight: normal; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-transform: none;"> <br/>
      </span></div>

    <div style="clear: both; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 10pt;" class="BRPFPageBreakArea">
      <div class="BRPFPageFooter" style="width: 100%;"></div>

