<div style="text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;">The carrying value of financial instruments including cash and cash equivalents, accounts receivable and accounts payable approximate fair values due to the short-term
      nature of these instruments. Fair value estimates are made at a specific point in time, based on relevant market information.</div>
</ix:continuation>
