<div style="text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;">The following table provides a summary of changes in fair value of the Company&#8217;s Level 3 life insurance contracts (U.S. dollars in thousands):</div>
</ix:continuation></ix:nonNumeric>
