    <div style="text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;">
      <ix:nonNumeric name="us-gaap:RevenueFromExternalCustomersByGeographicAreasTableTextBlock" id="Text_e40d376e9d324718a03558e70c32b8e5" contextRef="c20250101to20251231" escape="true" continuedAt="Text_9f05dab6f4244f078766d4ab9c7677931"><ix:continuation id="Text_d2e9da6f91cd448585f2d365f72bfffe36" continuedAt="Text_d2e9da6f91cd448585f2d365f72bfffe37">
<div style="text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman',Times,serif; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',Times,serif; font-weight: normal;">A major market is defined as one with
          total revenue greater than 10% of consolidated total revenue </span><span style="font-weight: normal;">and also includes the Company&#8217;s country of domicile (the United States). </span>Based on this criteria, the Company has identified <ix:nonFraction name="nus:NumberOfMajorMarkets" id="Fact_54543dc0288c4a0b89d333242c8865d8" contextRef="c20250101to20251231" unitRef="U009" decimals="INF" scale="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen">four</ix:nonFraction> major markets: Mainland China, South Korea, United States, and Japan. There are approximately <ix:nonFraction name="nus:NumberOfOtherMarkets" id="Fact_101028b5129143f781a0f892bb67bba0" contextRef="c20250101to20251231" unitRef="U009" decimals="0" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">45</ix:nonFraction> other markets, each of which individually is less than 10%.<span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman';">&#160;</span>No single customer accounted for
        10% or more of net sales for the periods presented. Sales are recorded in the jurisdiction in which the transactions occurred:</div>
</ix:continuation></ix:nonNumeric>
    </div>

